```sql
SET debug_verify_serializer=true;
SELECT * FROM read_parquet(
    'data/parquet-testing/invalid.parquet',
    utf8_validation='replace'
);
```
Expected: `TREL?`. Actual: the strict-mode invalid UTF-8 error. Please add a versioned serialization property with `STRICT` as its backward-compatible default and cover the logical-plan round trip.

